    "updated_at": "2019-12-29T12:20:14Z",
    "body": "You could do that with `find` or just with globbing in your script. But if/when someone makes an issue or PR for custom scripts you could mention that.\n\nNo it hasn't been implemented yet unfortunately. I've been waiting for that feature for awhile as I've got several (poorly written) modules that I use for my own things that wouldn't make sense to merge to upstream, and a solution like the one I mentioned in my earlier comment would be a much nicer way of managing those.",
